# Normalize line endings to LF for every text file, regardless of platform
# or local core.autocrlf setting - this repo's shell scripts break under
# CRLF (a shebang line ending in \r fails to exec), and mixed endings were
# producing spurious "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on every commit
# from Windows/Git Bash.
* text=auto eol=lf
